# Never publish: this file keeps genetic data and third-party programs out of git.
# Read repo/THIRD-PARTY.md before publishing this pipeline anywhere.

# ---- Your genetic data (the whole point of this file) --------------------
# work/ holds your genotypes, haplotypes and archaic segments; results/ and
# logs/ quote your data and absolute paths. A published genome cannot be
# withdrawn, and it also discloses information about your blood relatives.
repo/work/
repo/results/
repo/logs/
repo/config.env
repo/.skill_runtime/

# Raw and aligned reads, variant calls, in case they are kept here
*.fastq
*.fastq.gz
*.fq
*.fq.gz
*.bam
*.bai
*.cram
*.crai
*.vcf
*.vcf.gz
*.vcf.gz.tbi
*.haps
*.haps.gz
*.sample.gz
*.anc
*.mut
*.trees

# ---- Third-party programs (redistributing them may breach their licence) -
# Relate in particular is licensed for academic non-commercial use and its
# terms forbid redistribution; never commit it.
repo/tools/
repo/.venv/
.venv/

# ---- Downloaded reference data (large; fetched by the skills) ------------
repo/data/

# ---- Copyrighted papers -------------------------------------------------
# The Science paper and its supplementary materials are copyrighted; do not
# commit them. Cite the DOI instead.
*.pdf

# ---- Ordinary noise -----------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
